A minimal Go HTTP service with:

- `/healthz` and `/readyz` probes
- structured `slog` JSON logging
- graceful shutdown on SIGINT/SIGTERM
- a single end-to-end test

## Run

```bash
go run ./...
# in another shell:
curl http://localhost:8080/healthz
```

## Test

```bash
go test ./...
```

## Forge hygiene

This project ships with:

- `.gitignore` — managed by `forge upgrade gitignore`
- `.gitleaks.toml` — secret-scan rule pack managed by `forge upgrade gitleaks`
- `.forge/manifest` — drives `forge clean`

Run `forge clean --check` before every commit.
